{"seq":3,"slug":"code-splitting","title":"代码分割","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/performance/code-splitting","wordCount":616,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"代码分割\">代码分割</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>代码分割（Code Splitting）把不断膨胀的 bundle 拆成多个小块按需加载，显著减少初始加载与解析时间。它的底层原语是动态 <code>import()</code>，打包器识别后自动创建独立 chunk，React 侧则由 <code>React.lazy</code> + <code>Suspense</code> 承接组件级分割。本章讲解代码分割的原理、组件级与路由级分割策略、预加载时机，以及如何用打包分析定位可拆分的部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么需要代码分割\">为什么需要代码分割</h2><p>随着应用规模增长，JavaScript bundle 体积越来越大。用户必须下载并解析全部代码后才能使用应用。<strong>代码分割（Code Splitting）</strong> 将 bundle 拆分为多个小块，按需加载，显著减少初始加载时间。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 未分割&#10;        A[&quot;bundle.js (2MB)&quot;]&#10;        A --&gt; B[下载 2MB]&#10;        B --&gt; C[解析 2MB]&#10;        C --&gt; D[可交互]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 代码分割&#10;        E[&quot;main.js (200KB)&quot;]&#10;        E --&gt; F[下载 200KB]&#10;        F --&gt; G[解析 200KB]&#10;        G --&gt; H[可交互]&#10;        H --&gt; I[&quot;按需加载其他 chunk&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 未分割\n        A[\"bundle.js (2MB)\"]\n        A --&gt; B[下载 2MB]\n        B --&gt; C[解析 2MB]\n        C --&gt; D[可交互]\n    end\n    subgraph 代码分割\n        E[\"main.js (200KB)\"]\n        E --&gt; F[下载 200KB]\n        F --&gt; G[解析 200KB]\n        G --&gt; H[可交互]\n        H --&gt; I[\"按需加载其他 chunk\"]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>未分割</th>\n<th>代码分割后</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>初始 JS 体积</td>\n<td>2MB</td>\n<td>200KB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次可交互时间</td>\n<td>5s</td>\n<td>1.5s</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总 JS 体积</td>\n<td>2MB</td>\n<td>2.1MB（略大）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"react-lazy\">React.lazy</h2><p><code>React.lazy</code> 让你可以像使用普通组件一样使用动态导入的组件，配合 Suspense 显示加载状态：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { lazy, Suspense } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;&#10;const Dashboard = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./Dashboard&#39;));&#10;const Settings = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./Settings&#39;));&#10;const Analytics = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./Analytics&#39;));&#10;&#10;function App() {&#10;  const [page, setPage] = useState&lt;&#39;dashboard&#39; | &#39;settings&#39; | &#39;analytics&#39;&gt;(&#39;dashboard&#39;);&#10;&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;div&gt;&#10;      &lt;nav&gt;&#10;        &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; setPage(&#39;dashboard&#39;)}&gt;仪表盘&lt;/button&gt;&#10;        &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; setPage(&#39;settings&#39;)}&gt;设置&lt;/button&gt;&#10;        &lt;button onClick={() =&gt; setPage(&#39;analytics&#39;)}&gt;分析&lt;/button&gt;&#10;      &lt;/nav&gt;&#10;      &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;PageSkeleton /&gt;}&gt;&#10;        {page === &#39;dashboard&#39; &amp;&amp; &lt;Dashboard /&gt;}&#10;        {page === &#39;settings&#39; &amp;&amp; &lt;Settings /&gt;}&#10;        {page === &#39;analytics&#39; &amp;&amp; &lt;Analytics /&gt;}&#10;      &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;    &lt;/div&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { lazy, Suspense } from 'react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const Dashboard = lazy(() => import('./Dashboard'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const Settings = lazy(() => import('./Settings'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const Analytics = lazy(() => import('./Analytics'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const [page, setPage] = useState&#x3C;'dashboard' | 'settings' | 'analytics'>('dashboard');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;nav></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;button onClick={() => setPage('dashboard')}>仪表盘&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;button onClick={() => setPage('settings')}>设置&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;button onClick={() => setPage('analytics')}>分析&#x3C;/button></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/nav></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;PageSkeleton />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {page === 'dashboard' &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;Dashboard />}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {page === 'settings' &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;Settings />}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {page === 'analytics' &#x26;&#x26; &#x3C;Analytics />}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/div></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"命名导出\">命名导出</h3><p><code>React.lazy</code> 只支持默认导出。对于命名导出，需要中间模块：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"// MathUtils.ts&#10;export function add(a: number, b: number) {&#10;  return a + b;&#10;}&#10;export function Chart() {&#10;  return &lt;div&gt;Chart&lt;/div&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;// ChartLazy.ts&#10;export { Chart as default } from &#39;./MathUtils&#39;;&#10;&#10;// App.tsx&#10;const Chart = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./ChartLazy&#39;));&#10;&#10;// 或直接使用 then&#10;const Chart = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./MathUtils&#39;).then((mod) =&gt; ({ default: mod.Chart })));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// MathUtils.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export function add(a: number, b: number) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return a + b;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export function Chart() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;div>Chart&#x3C;/div>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// ChartLazy.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>export { Chart as default } from './MathUtils';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// App.tsx</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const Chart = lazy(() => import('./ChartLazy'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 或直接使用 then</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const Chart = lazy(() => import('./MathUtils').then((mod) => ({ default: mod.Chart })));</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"dynamic-import\">Dynamic Import</h2><p><code>import()</code> 是代码分割的底层原语。Webpack、Vite 等打包器遇到 <code>import()</code> 会自动创建新的 chunk：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"async function loadHeavyModule() {&#10;  const module = await import(&#39;./heavy-computation&#39;);&#10;  return module.processData(data);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 带条件的动态加载&#10;async function handleExport(format: &#39;pdf&#39; | &#39;csv&#39; | &#39;xlsx&#39;) {&#10;  switch (format) {&#10;    case &#39;pdf&#39;: {&#10;      const { generatePDF } = await import(&#39;./exporters/pdf&#39;);&#10;      return generatePDF(data);&#10;    }&#10;    case &#39;csv&#39;: {&#10;      const { generateCSV } = await import(&#39;./exporters/csv&#39;);&#10;      return generateCSV(data);&#10;    }&#10;    case &#39;xlsx&#39;: {&#10;      const { generateXLSX } = await import(&#39;./exporters/xlsx&#39;);&#10;      return generateXLSX(data);&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>async function loadHeavyModule() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const module = await import('./heavy-computation');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return module.processData(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 带条件的动态加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async function handleExport(format: 'pdf' | 'csv' | 'xlsx') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  switch (format) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    case 'pdf': {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const { generatePDF } = await import('./exporters/pdf');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return generatePDF(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    case 'csv': {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const { generateCSV } = await import('./exporters/csv');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return generateCSV(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    case 'xlsx': {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const { generateXLSX } = await import('./exporters/xlsx');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return generateXLSX(data);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;import()&quot;] --&gt; B[打包器识别]&#10;    B --&gt; C[创建独立 chunk]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;运行时按需加载&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{已加载过?}&#10;    E -- 是 --&gt; F[使用缓存]&#10;    E -- 否 --&gt; G[发起网络请求]&#10;    G --&gt; H[下载 chunk]&#10;    H --&gt; I[执行并缓存]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"import()\"] --&gt; B[打包器识别]\n    B --&gt; C[创建独立 chunk]\n    C --&gt; D[\"运行时按需加载\"]\n    D --&gt; E{已加载过?}\n    E -- 是 --&gt; F[使用缓存]\n    E -- 否 --&gt; G[发起网络请求]\n    G --&gt; H[下载 chunk]\n    H --&gt; I[执行并缓存]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"route-based-splitting\">Route-Based Splitting</h2><p>最常见且效果最好的代码分割策略是<strong>基于路由分割</strong>——每个路由对应一个 chunk：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"import { lazy, Suspense } from &#39;react&#39;;&#10;import { Routes, Route } from &#39;react-router-dom&#39;;&#10;&#10;const Home = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/Home&#39;));&#10;const Blog = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/Blog&#39;));&#10;const BlogPost = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/BlogPost&#39;));&#10;const Profile = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/Profile&#39;));&#10;const Admin = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/Admin&#39;));&#10;&#10;function App() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Suspense fallback={&lt;GlobalSpinner /&gt;}&gt;&#10;      &lt;Routes&gt;&#10;        &lt;Route path=&quot;/&quot; element={&lt;Home /&gt;} /&gt;&#10;        &lt;Route path=&quot;/blog&quot; element={&lt;Blog /&gt;} /&gt;&#10;        &lt;Route path=&quot;/blog/:slug&quot; element={&lt;BlogPost /&gt;} /&gt;&#10;        &lt;Route path=&quot;/profile&quot; element={&lt;Profile /&gt;} /&gt;&#10;        &lt;Route path=&quot;/admin/*&quot; element={&lt;Admin /&gt;} /&gt;&#10;      &lt;/Routes&gt;&#10;    &lt;/Suspense&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { lazy, Suspense } from 'react';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>import { Routes, Route } from 'react-router-dom';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const Home = lazy(() => import('./pages/Home'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const Blog = lazy(() => import('./pages/Blog'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const BlogPost = lazy(() => import('./pages/BlogPost'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const Profile = lazy(() => import('./pages/Profile'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const Admin = lazy(() => import('./pages/Admin'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Suspense fallback={&#x3C;GlobalSpinner />}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;Routes></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Route path=\"/\" element={&#x3C;Home />} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Route path=\"/blog\" element={&#x3C;Blog />} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Route path=\"/blog/:slug\" element={&#x3C;BlogPost />} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Route path=\"/profile\" element={&#x3C;Profile />} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Route path=\"/admin/*\" element={&#x3C;Admin />} /></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      &#x3C;/Routes></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/Suspense></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分割策略</th>\n<th>粒度</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基于路由</td>\n<td>页面级</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基于组件</td>\n<td>组件级</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>精细</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基于功能</td>\n<td>功能模块级</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>灵活</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基于交互</td>\n<td>用户操作触发</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>最优</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"module-preloading\">Module Preloading</h2><p>代码分割的缺点是用户切换路由时需要等待 chunk 下载。<strong>预加载（Preloading）</strong> 可以在用户可能导航之前就开始下载：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"const AdminPage = lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/Admin&#39;));&#10;&#10;function preloadAdmin() {&#10;  import(&#39;./pages/Admin&#39;);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function NavItem() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;Link to=&quot;/admin&quot; onMouseEnter={preloadAdmin} onFocus={preloadAdmin}&gt;&#10;      管理后台&#10;    &lt;/Link&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const AdminPage = lazy(() => import('./pages/Admin'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function preloadAdmin() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  import('./pages/Admin');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function NavItem() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;Link to=\"/admin\" onMouseEnter={preloadAdmin} onFocus={preloadAdmin}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      管理后台</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/Link></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"基于路由的预加载\">基于路由的预加载</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"interface RouteConfig {&#10;  path: string;&#10;  component: React.LazyExoticComponent&lt;React.ComponentType&gt;;&#10;  preload: () =&gt; Promise&lt;unknown&gt;;&#10;}&#10;&#10;const routes: RouteConfig[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    path: &#39;/dashboard&#39;,&#10;    component: lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/Dashboard&#39;)),&#10;    preload: () =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/Dashboard&#39;),&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    path: &#39;/settings&#39;,&#10;    component: lazy(() =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/Settings&#39;)),&#10;    preload: () =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/Settings&#39;),&#10;  },&#10;];&#10;&#10;function Navigation() {&#10;  return (&#10;    &lt;nav&gt;&#10;      {routes.map((route) =&gt; (&#10;        &lt;Link key={route.path} to={route.path} onMouseEnter={() =&gt; route.preload()}&gt;&#10;          {route.path}&#10;        &lt;/Link&gt;&#10;      ))}&#10;    &lt;/nav&gt;&#10;  );&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface RouteConfig {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  path: string;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  component: React.LazyExoticComponent&#x3C;React.ComponentType>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  preload: () => Promise&#x3C;unknown>;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const routes: RouteConfig[] = [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    path: '/dashboard',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    component: lazy(() => import('./pages/Dashboard')),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    preload: () => import('./pages/Dashboard'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    path: '/settings',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    component: lazy(() => import('./pages/Settings')),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    preload: () => import('./pages/Settings'),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function Navigation() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;nav></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      {routes.map((route) => (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;Link key={route.path} to={route.path} onMouseEnter={() => route.preload()}></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>          {route.path}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        &#x3C;/Link></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      ))}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    &#x3C;/nav></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  );</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"使用-link-标签预加载\">使用 link 标签预加载</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"tsx\" data-code=\"function usePreloadOnIdle(importFn: () =&gt; Promise&lt;unknown&gt;) {&#10;  useEffect(() =&gt; {&#10;    if (&#39;requestIdleCallback&#39; in window) {&#10;      const id = requestIdleCallback(() =&gt; importFn());&#10;      return () =&gt; cancelIdleCallback(id);&#10;    }&#10;    const timer = setTimeout(() =&gt; importFn(), 2000);&#10;    return () =&gt; clearTimeout(timer);&#10;  }, [importFn]);&#10;}&#10;&#10;function App() {&#10;  usePreloadOnIdle(() =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/Settings&#39;));&#10;  usePreloadOnIdle(() =&gt; import(&#39;./pages/Profile&#39;));&#10;&#10;  return &lt;MainContent /&gt;;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>function usePreloadOnIdle(importFn: () => Promise&#x3C;unknown>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  useEffect(() => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if ('requestIdleCallback' in window) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const id = requestIdleCallback(() => importFn());</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      return () => cancelIdleCallback(id);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const timer = setTimeout(() => importFn(), 2000);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    return () => clearTimeout(timer);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }, [importFn]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>function App() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  usePreloadOnIdle(() => import('./pages/Settings'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  usePreloadOnIdle(() => import('./pages/Profile'));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  return &#x3C;MainContent />;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[首页加载完成] --&gt; B{浏览器空闲?}&#10;    B -- 是 --&gt; C[&quot;预加载 Settings chunk&quot;]&#10;    B -- 是 --&gt; D[&quot;预加载 Profile chunk&quot;]&#10;    B -- 否 --&gt; E[等待空闲]&#10;    E --&gt; B&#10;&#10;    F[用户悬停导航] --&gt; G[&quot;立即预加载目标 chunk&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[用户点击时已加载完毕]&#10;    H --&gt; I[无需等待, 立即显示]\">flowchart TD\n    A[首页加载完成] --&gt; B{浏览器空闲?}\n    B -- 是 --&gt; C[\"预加载 Settings chunk\"]\n    B -- 是 --&gt; D[\"预加载 Profile chunk\"]\n    B -- 否 --&gt; E[等待空闲]\n    E --&gt; B\n\n    F[用户悬停导航] --&gt; G[\"立即预加载目标 chunk\"]\n    G --&gt; H[用户点击时已加载完毕]\n    H --&gt; I[无需等待, 立即显示]</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 预加载策略建议：(1) 鼠标悬停时预加载链接目标 (2) 空闲时预加载高概率访问的路由 (3) 视口内可见的链接预加载。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>代码分割</strong> 将大 bundle 拆分为按需加载的小 chunk，显著减少初始加载时间</li>\n<li><code>React.lazy</code> + <code>Suspense</code> 是组件级代码分割的标准方案</li>\n<li><strong>基于路由分割</strong> 是最常见且效果最好的策略</li>\n<li><strong>预加载</strong> 通过 hover、focus、idle 时机提前下载 chunk，消除切换延迟</li>\n<li><code>import()</code> 是代码分割的底层原语，打包器自动识别并创建独立 chunk</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代码分割","id":"代码分割"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要代码分割","id":"为什么需要代码分割"},{"level":2,"text":"React.lazy","id":"react-lazy"},{"level":3,"text":"命名导出","id":"命名导出"},{"level":2,"text":"Dynamic Import","id":"dynamic-import"},{"level":2,"text":"Route-Based Splitting","id":"route-based-splitting"},{"level":2,"text":"Module Preloading","id":"module-preloading"},{"level":3,"text":"基于路由的预加载","id":"基于路由的预加载"},{"level":3,"text":"使用 link 标签预加载","id":"使用-link-标签预加载"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"虚拟列表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/performance/virtual-list"},"next":{"title":"性能分析与 DevTools","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/react-in-depth/performance/profiling-and-devtools"}}